const normalized = value => String(value ?? '').normalize('NFKD').replace(/[\u0300-\u036f]/g, '').toLowerCase().replace(/\bekg\b/g, 'ecg').replace(/[^a-z0-9]+/g, ' ').trim();

export function searchCatalog(query = '', {category = 'all'} = {}) {
  const terms = normalized(query).split(' ').filter(Boolean);
  return deviceCatalog.filter(device => {
    if (category && category !== 'all' && device.category !== category) return false;
    const text = normalized([device.name, device.manufacturer, device.model, device.category, ...device.metrics, ...device.aliases].join(' '));
    return terms.every(term => text.includes(term));
  });
}
